---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Insurance & Coverage"
  description="Understand how insurance works for fertility care at IRFC. Verify your benefits, learn what may be covered, and explore self-pay options."
>
  <Nav />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="pt-40 pb-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="h-px w-12" style="background: var(--color-gold-500);"></div>
          <span class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase" style="color: var(--color-gold-600); font-family: var(--font-sans);">Insurance &amp; Coverage</span>
        </div>
        <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-serif);" class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-light text-stone-800 mb-6 leading-none">
          Care that works<br/>
          <em class="not-italic" style="color: var(--color-gold-500);">with your coverage.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-stone-500 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-10">
          Fertility benefits vary by plan. Our team will help you understand what your insurance may cover and how to make the most of it &mdash; with clear answers, never surprises.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14244324732" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            Call (424) 432-4732
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/14244324732" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-outline inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            Message Us on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28" style="background: var(--color-stone-50);">
    <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">
      <div class="mb-14">
        <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-2" style="color: var(--color-stone-400); font-family: var(--font-sans);">How to use your benefits</p>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif);" class="text-3xl font-light text-stone-800">Three steps to clarity</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
        <div>
          <p class="text-5xl font-light mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-gold-400);">01</p>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif);" class="text-2xl font-light text-stone-800 mb-3">Verify your benefits</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Call our team or sign in to the patient portal so we can check your plan's fertility coverage before your first visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-5xl font-light mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-gold-400);">02</p>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif);" class="text-2xl font-light text-stone-800 mb-3">Know what's covered</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Diagnostic testing is often covered; treatment coverage depends on your plan. We walk you through the difference in plain language.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-5xl font-light mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-gold-400);">03</p>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-serif);" class="text-2xl font-light text-stone-800 mb-3">We handle the rest</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">From prior authorizations to claims, our billing coordinators manage the paperwork so you can focus on your care.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Self-pay -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-10">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-2" style="color: var(--color-stone-400); font-family: var(--font-sans);">No coverage? No problem</p>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif);" class="text-3xl font-light text-stone-800 mb-4">Flexible self-pay options</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">If your plan does not include fertility care, transparent pricing and monthly payment plans keep exceptional care within reach. Explore costs and financing in one place.</p>
        <a href="/financing" class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          View Financing &amp; Cost
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
